---
id: mediterranean-garden-salad-lemon-dijon
title: Mediterranean Garden Salad with Lemon-Dijon Vinaigrette
category: fresh_salad_veg

yield:
  servings: 1
  cooked_g: 462

storage:
  fridge_days: 1
  freezer_friendly: false

---

Whisk @olive-oil{1%tsp}, @dijon-mustard{1%tsp}, juice squeezed from @fresh-lemon{0.25}, @kosher-salt{0.25%tsp}, and @black-pepper{0.25%tsp} in the bottom of a serving bowl until thick and opaque.

Slice @mini-cucumbers{2} into rounds, quarter @campari-tomatoes{3}, dice @mixed-bell-peppers{0.5}, thinly slice @red-onion{0.25}, and chop @italian-parsley{10%g} with @fresh-dill{10%g}.

Add all chopped produce to the bowl over the dressing and toss for 15 to 20 seconds until every vegetable is coated. Eat immediately.
